  notes: |
    Custom presets whose name shadows a built-in are dropped on
    module load (silent migration). Fixes the case where a user
    loads a builtin, edits, and saves as custom with the same name —
    the resulting custom shadows the updated builtin in the dropdown
    and confused the operator into thinking the update didn't apply
    (happened 4× in a row with Für Elise).
    localStorage is rewritten so the shadow doesn't return on next
    load. See packet for rationale and edge cases.